    "overview": "A simple research journal combines evidence tables with a full-width measured series. Light paper, dark green ink and restrained warning ochre support detailed reading by one researcher. The interface remains an operating and reading surface, with no decorative charts or fabricated metrics.\n\nSerif journal headings frame familiar sans-serif controls and tables. The chart is a working plot with date ranges and exact values; limitations remain adjacent to the evidence. Local assets and a locally served display font keep the journal independent of external font services.",
